# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WEB APP environment (apps/web)
#
# ⚠️  EVERYTHING HERE IS PUBLIC.
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the JavaScript bundle, which is served to
# every visitor and readable with View Source. Never put an API key, token, or
# any other secret in this file. Backend secrets live in apps/server/.env and
# are deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_ so they can never be bundled.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend origin. Leave blank in development: the Vite dev server proxies
# /api and /ws to localhost:8787, so same-origin just works.
#
#   development   http://localhost:8787   (or blank)
#   production    https://YOUR-SERVICE.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=

# WebSocket origin. Leave blank to derive it from VITE_API_URL, which maps
# http→ws and https→wss automatically. Set it only when the socket lives on a
# different host from the REST API.
#
#   development   ws://localhost:8787
#   production    wss://YOUR-SERVICE.onrender.com
VITE_WS_URL=
